<!doctype html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>TheNewTips - Subscribe Page</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#0f172a;--card:#111827;--accent:#06b6d4;--txt:#e6f0f6}
    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter, system-ui, Arial, sans-serif;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#071024 0%,#071a2a 100%);color:var(--txt);min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:24px}
    .container{width:100%;max-width:900px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),rgba(255,255,255,0.01));border-radius:16px;padding:28px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.6)}
    header{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:96px;height:96px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#3b82f6);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:20px;color:#03202a}
    h1{margin:0;font-size:22px}
    p.lead{margin:6px 0 0;color:#cfe7ef}
    .buttons{margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .btn{background:var(--accent);color:#03202a;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
    .btn.secondary{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);color:var(--txt)}
    .embed{margin-top:18px;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}
    .howto{margin-top:22px;background:#071a2a;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;color:#a9dce6}
    code{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);padding:4px 6px;border-radius:6px;color:#d7fbff}
    footer{margin-top:18px;color:#7fbfcc;font-size:13px}
    @media (max-width:600px){header{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}.logo{width:72px;height:72px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <header>
      <div class="logo">TN</div>
      <div>
        <h1>TheNewTips — Official Subscribe Page</h1>
        <p class="lead">Aapke channel ka simple landing page — logo, subscribe button aur recent video ka link.</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- IMPORTANT: agar aapka YouTube handle ya direct channel url badalna ho, yahan update karen -->
    <!-- Channel link use karke subscribe pop-up khulega: channel_handle?sub_confirmation=1 -->

    <div class="buttons">
      <a class="btn" href="https://www.youtube.com/@thenewtips?sub_confirmation=1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Subscribe karein</a>
      <a class="btn secondary" href="https://www.youtube.com/@thenewtips" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Channel dekhen</a>
      <a class="btn secondary" id="copyLink">Subscribe link copy karein</a>
    </div>

    <div class="embed">
      <!-- Optional: agar aap kisi specific video ka embed code chahte hain to yahan iframe add karen -->
      <iframe width="100%" height="360" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed?listType=user_uploads&list=@thenewtips" title="YouTube videos" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen></iframe>
    </div>

    <div class="howto">
      <strong>Local par chalane ka tarika (Windows/Mac/Linux):</strong>
      <ol>
        <li>Is file ko <code>index.html</code> ke naam se save karein.</li>
        <li>Terminal/Command Prompt kholen aur folder tak jaakar: <code>python3 -m http.server 8000</code> (ya Windows me <code>python -m http.server 8000</code>).</li>
        <li>Browser me open karein: <code>http://localhost:8000</code></li>
      </ol>

      <hr/>
      <strong>Free mein public karne ke 2 simple tareeqe (steps):</strong>
      <h4>1) GitHub Pages (recommended, free & permanent)</h4>
      <ol>
        <li>GitHub pe account banayein (agar nahi hai).</li>
        <li>Naya repository banayein, naam jaise <code>thenewtips-site</code>.</li>
        <li>Is <code>index.html</code> ko repo me upload karein ("Add file" → "Upload files").</li>
        <li>Repo ki Settings → Pages (ya Code and automation → Pages) me jaakar branch <code>main</code> aur folder <code>/ (root)</code> select karein aur Save karein.</li>
        <li>Kuch minute me site active ho jayega: <code>https://YOUR_GITHUB_USERNAME.github.io/thenewtips-site/</code></li>
      </ol>

      <h4>2) Ngrok (temporary public URL, testing ke liye best)</h4>
      <ol>
        <li><a href="https://ngrok.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ngrok</a> pe free account banayein aur auth token lein.</li>
        <li>Ngrok install karein aur terminal me login karein: <code>ngrok authtoken YOUR_TOKEN</code></li>
        <li>Local server chala ke (port 8000) run karein: <code>ngrok http 8000</code></li>
        <li>Ngrok aapko ek public URL dega (https) jo kisi ko bhi share kiya ja sakta hai — temporary hota hai.</li>
      </ol>

      <hr/>
      <strong>Customize karna hai?</strong>
      <p>Text, colors, logo ya channel URL badalna ho to code me <code>&lt;header&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;a href=...&gt;</code> aur <code>iframe</code> wale parts ko edit karein. Agar aap chahen, main aapke liye GitHub repo bana kar push kar dunga — bas bataiye.</p>
    </div>

    <footer>Made with ❤️ for <strong>@thenewtips</strong> — Simple, fast, and free.</footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    document.getElementById('copyLink').addEventListener('click',function(){
      const subUrl = 'https://www.youtube.com/@thenewtips?sub_confirmation=1';
      navigator.clipboard?.writeText(subUrl).then(()=>{
        alert('Subscribe link copy ho gaya: ' + subUrl);
      }).catch(()=>{ prompt('Copy karein ye link:', subUrl); });
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>
